From 897c8a4ae3c2b9d01806c6850af4d1e8151a9282 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 09:58:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix permission resolution, add group rank perms, admin panel,
 division-scoped promotions, cleaner activity log, and division auto-redirect

- Fix bug where division-rank-granted permissions (e.g. can_award_points) were ignored; usePermissions now merges user_permissions + group rank perms + division rank perms
- Add group_rank_permissions table + owner-only Admin Panel to grant perms by Roblox group rank
- Restrict division-only promoters (permission from division rank only) to their own division
- Remove login and onboarding_complete entries from activity_log (points/promotions only)
- Divisions page: members of a division without management perms are redirected straight to it; managers see a richer, bigger tile overview
